{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"油麻地單位起火　無人受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-YMT-261026-11.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】油麻地有單位起火，無人受傷。</p><p>位於大廈後巷3樓的單位火光熊熊，消防員趕到拖喉進入現場撲救。</p><p>警方早上9時許接報，茂林街16至18號3樓一個單位起火。消防派出煙帽隊進入火場灌救，約10分鐘後將火救熄。</p><p>事件中無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:24.386238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:05:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:17.256438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:44.215060+00:00","content_hash":"705e1eaf235916e07688e420f5cd8219eee1516a96ab5bff131bb02c0a760516","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}